---
title: A TCP header
---
packet-beta
%% A packet's fields: rows of 32 bits, each field over its bits.
0-15: "Source port"
16-31: "Destination port"
32-63: "Sequence number"
64-95: "Acknowledgment number"
96-99: "Offset"
100-105: "Reserved"
106: "URG"
107: "ACK"
108: "PSH"
109: "RST"
110: "SYN"
111: "FIN"
112-127: "Window"
128-143: "Checksum"
144-159: "Urgent pointer"
160-191: "Options and padding"
